 "Bamboo gives a natural, minimal or resort look, with a different weight and grain from typical solid wooden slats. Light blocking is usually softer and more open than solid wood or aluminium blinds.",
 "What kind of light filtering, and which rooms suit them?",
 "Best for rooms that want soft light and a natural atmosphere, such as living rooms and indoor balconies. For full darkness for daytime sleep, you may need to combine them with blackout curtains.",
 "How do I prevent mould and fading?",
 "Dust regularly, keep the room well ventilated and avoid direct high humidity. If used near windows exposed to rain, protect them with glass or an awning.",
