 "How does the Euro partition differ from the USA partition?",
 "The Euro partition usually has large acrylic windows across the whole panel, so it is open and lets in lots of light. The USA partition places acrylic windows at intervals, alternating solid and clear in different proportions. Choose by the privacy you need.",
